---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

const updated = '2026-05-25';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Use — AMRO Pro" description="Terms governing use of the AMRO Pro marketing site.">
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 py-20">
    <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500">Legal</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Terms of Use</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: {updated}</p>

    <div class="prose prose-slate mt-10 max-w-none prose-headings:font-semibold prose-headings:tracking-tight prose-h2:mt-10 prose-h2:text-2xl">
      <p>
        These terms govern your use of the AMRO Pro marketing site at{' '}
        <strong>amropro.sosservices.online</strong>. Use of the AMRO Pro application is
        governed by a separate Master Services Agreement signed at pilot kickoff.
      </p>

      <h2>Closed pilot status</h2>
      <p>
        AMRO Pro is in closed pilot. The contact form is purely a demo-request
        mechanism — submitting it does not constitute a commercial engagement.
      </p>

      <h2>No regulatory advice on this site</h2>
      <p>
        Descriptions of FAA / EASA / CAAC / SACAA workflows on this site are summaries
        of how AMRO Pro models them, not authoritative interpretations of regulation.
        Always consult the relevant authority for binding requirements.
      </p>

      <h2>No warranties</h2>
      <p>
        This site is provided as-is. We make no warranties about uptime, accuracy of
        descriptions of unreleased features, or fitness for any particular purpose.
      </p>

      <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>
        To the maximum extent permitted by law, SOS Services is not liable for indirect,
        incidental, or consequential damages arising from your use of this site.
      </p>

      <h2>Governing law</h2>
      <p>
        These terms are governed by the laws of India, with courts in Bangalore having
        exclusive jurisdiction.
      </p>

      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500">
        Questions? <a href="/contact">Contact us</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
